• Decentralized Model Privacy: Because vital mathematical fragments of the AI model's runtime execution live exclusively inside memory slots scattered across thousands of private residential homes, the model's core intelligence is structurally fragmented. A security breach at the central data center cannot expose the entire operational model matrix, as critical components are encrypted and hosted across the global edge network.
